      "statusChangeNewStatus": "needs more information",
      "value": "We have not been able to reproduce this issue, it seems to be working as expected. Note that this is the error message you would get if the instance ID is invalid or you do not have permission to join the instance based on the instance type. For example, if you want to send a link to an invite-only instance, you should copy the unlocked link, which gives them permission to join as if they had an invite. \n\nIf the other person is given an unlocked link, then when they right-click copy the \"Launch World\" button, it will give them the vrchat:// formatted ID with the unlocked instance built in, which will give them permission to join.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
